### Ejecuta authLogin una vez en este archivo para obtener un token sin copiarlo.
# Selecciona admin, despacho o custom en el entorno de REST Client.
@accessToken = {{authLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}

# @name authLogin
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "{{authUsername}}",
  "password": "{{authPassword}}"
}

### 1. Crear una nueva carrera para pruebas de Pago
# @name CreateTripPayment
POST http://localhost:4000/api/carreras
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passenger_id": 1,
  "shift_id": 1,
  "fare_id": 1
}

### 2. Guardar el ID de la carrera
@newTripPaymentId = {{CreateTripPayment.response.body.$.trip.id}}

### 3. POST 409 — Trip no está cerrada (intentar pagar estando solicitada)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/pagos
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reference_id": {{newTripPaymentId}},
  "payment_method": "nequi"
}

### 4. Avanzar la carrera hasta cerrada
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/carreras/{{newTripPaymentId}}/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "aceptada" }

###
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/carreras/{{newTripPaymentId}}/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "en_curso" }

###
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/carreras/{{newTripPaymentId}}/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "cerrada" }

### 5. POST — Pago válido sobre carrera cerrada
POST http://localhost:4000/api/pagos
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reference_id": {{newTripPaymentId}},
  "payment_method": "efectivo"
}

### 6. POST 404 — Carrera inexistente
POST http://localhost:4000/api/pagos
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reference_id": 99999,
  "payment_method": "tarjeta"
}
